@startuml Fluxo de Doação via PIX
' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
'  Fluxo de Doação via PIX (Mercado Pago)
' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundCorner 8
skinparam SequenceMessageAlignment center

skinparam participant {
  BackgroundColor #FAFAFA
  BorderColor #BDBDBD
  FontStyle bold
}

skinparam sequence {
  ArrowThickness 1.5
  ArrowColor #555555
  LifeLineBorderColor #CCCCCC
  LifeLineBackgroundColor #F5F5F5
  GroupBorderColor #1976D2
  GroupBackgroundColor #E3F2FD
  DividerBorderColor #CCCCCC
}

title **Fluxo de Doação via PIX**

actor "👤 Usuário" as U
participant "⚡ API" as API #E3F2FD
participant "💳 Mercado\nPago" as MP #FFF3E0
database "🐘 PostgreSQL" as DB #E8EAF6
queue "📨 Email\nQueue" as Q #FFEBEE
participant "📧 Mailer" as M #F3E5F5

== 1. Iniciando pagamento ==

U -> API : POST /payments/initiate\n{ causeId, amount }
activate API

API -> DB : Cria Payment\n(status: PENDING)
activate DB
DB --> API : payment.id
deactivate DB

API -> MP : Cria pagamento PIX
activate MP
MP --> API : { qrCode, mpPaymentId }
deactivate MP

API -> DB : Atualiza Payment\n(mpPaymentId, qrCode)

API --> U : { qrCode, qrCodeBase64,\n  paymentId, status }
deactivate API

== 2. Usuário paga ==

U -> MP : Escaneia QR Code\ne confirma PIX
note right of U : O pagamento é\nprocessado pelo\nMercado Pago

== 3. Webhook de confirmação ==

MP -> API : POST /payments/webhook\n{ type: "payment", data.id }
activate API

API -> MP : GET /v1/payments/:id\n(confirma status)
activate MP
MP --> API : status: "approved" ✅
deactivate MP

group Transação atômica
  API -> DB : Cria Donation
  API -> DB : Incrementa raised + balance (Cause)
  API -> DB : Incrementa xpPoints (User)
  API -> DB : Cria UserBadge[] (se novos)
  API -> DB : Payment → APPROVED
end

API -> Q : Enfileira email de confirmação
activate Q

API --> MP : 200 OK
deactivate API

== 4. Email assíncrono ==

Q -> M : Processa job (3 retries)
activate M
M --> U : 📧 Confirmação de doação\n(XP ganho + badges)
deactivate M
deactivate Q

@enduml
